# Local build artefacts must not enter the build context: they carry host-specific absolute paths
# in project.assets.json, which makes the in-container restore/publish fail in ways that never
# reproduce in CI (where the checkout is clean).
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/publish/

.git/
.github/
.vs/
**/*.user
tests/

# Never bake local secrets into an image layer.
**/appsettings.Development.json
.env
